                    <h1>Medi-Cal Provider Directory</h1>

                    <p>
                        If you cannot find a dentist in your area who is accepting new patients, please contact the Medi-Cal Telephone Service Center for additional help at 1-800-322-6384.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <strong>Show only providers accepting new patients:</strong>
                        The "Show only providers accepting new patients" field provides users an option to limit search results to dentists that currently accept new patients belonging to the selected benefit plan.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <strong>Note:</strong>
                        Many dentists will accept new patients for one-time emergency visits even if they do not accept them as long term patients. If a patient is in need of emergency treatment, avoid selecting the "Show only providers accepting new patients" option to allow the greatest number of possible dentists to be returned in the search results.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <strong>Note:</strong>
                        Some dentists require a referral from another dentist before they will accept new patients. Families should contact dentists to confirm whether they are currently accepting new patients under the selected benefit plan and for details regarding their referral policies.
                    </p>
